848
00:48:22.608 --> 00:48:25.152
jangan risau. Okay, bye.

849
00:48:27.947 --> 00:48:28.906
Apa yang dia cakap?

850
00:48:29.907 --> 00:48:32.785
Dia masih disoal siasat.
Semacam salah faham.

851
